andalay bay and  luxor chuck  well good morning and and and thank you  so much for inviting me here today  uh i want to start by congratulating  mark and the entire raiders organization  on this gorgeous stadium that's behind  me here today in this world-class  franchise that you have brought to las  vegas  you've already contributed so much to  the community i just want to take the  opportunity to say thank you for  spending the time giving back especially  over this last year  and know this foundation you've created  will be felt  for years to come now to say that we're  all excited about the 2021 football  season allegiant stadium might be the  biggest understatement over the  last year the return of fans to  large-scale sports and entertainment  represents the biggest milestone in our  city's recovery  it's one of the final pieces of the  puzzle of that recovery  bottom line we can't wait now one thing  i know is that mr davis and mr biden  have made a commitment to excitement and  excellence on the field  all the way to a world championship uh  they have also that will only be topped  by the excitement  that they will create from the time the  fans and the moment they arrive at  allegiant stadium  but see that's where the comparison to  any other city  in america stops and that's where las  vegas raises the bar  see we are here to create weekends of  memories  not just what happens over four hours  and i was at a press conference with  mark about a year ago  and said to people then and i will tell  you now i'm the luckiest person live  every day i drive by this incredible  stadium  only look right next door and see my  home of manley bay  and luxor see it's our job now to create  the energy from the moment visiting fans  arrive in the city  or when local fans wake up in the  morning for many that electric moment  will begin when they arrive  at these properties to enjoy the  credible festivities  we are planning all weekend long to  eventually walk  walk across